  tc_stmt -->|starts branch baseline| tc_flow_save_base
  tc_stmt -->|records successful branch| tc_flow_save_yes
  tc_stmt -->|restores baseline before next arm| tc_flow_restore_base
  tc_stmt -->|joins branch facts| tc_flow_merge_yes
  tc_stmt -->|closes branch frame| tc_flow_end
  tc_expr -->|checks closure/block bodies| tc_stmt
  tc_expr -->|manages expression-local scope| tc_enter_scope
  tc_expr -->|releases expression-local scope| tc_leave_scope
  tc_flow_merge_yes -->|uses saved successful snapshot| tc_flow_save_yes

  gen_program -->|collects declarations| gen_collect_stmt
  gen_program -->|emits functions| gen_function
  gen_program -->|emits top-level statements| gen_stmt
  gen_program -->|writes tokens| code_emit
  gen_program -->|writes runtime prelude| emit_runtime
  gen_collect_stmt -->|walks expressions| gen_collect_expr
  gen_collect_expr -->|reuses type/ownership metadata| tc_expr
  gen_function -->|emits body| gen_stmt
  gen_function -->|emits function cleanup| gen_emit_defer_from
  gen_function -->|writes signature/body tokens| code_emit
  gen_stmt -->|emits expressions| gen_expr
  gen_stmt -->|registers defer| gen_defer_push
  gen_stmt -->|emits return/branch cleanup| gen_emit_defer_from
  gen_stmt -->|emits function-end cleanup| gen_emit_all_defers
  gen_stmt -->|dispatches match| gen_match_stmt
  gen_stmt -->|checks terminal blocks| gen_stmt_terminates
  gen_stmt -->|writes statement tokens| code_emit
  gen_match_stmt -->|emits scrutinee and arm expressions| gen_expr
  gen_match_stmt -->|emits arm bodies| gen_stmt
  gen_match_stmt -->|checks arm termination| gen_stmt_terminates
  gen_match_stmt -->|emits arm cleanup| gen_emit_defer_from
  gen_match_stmt -->|writes match tokens| code_emit
  gen_expr -->|writes expression tokens| code_emit
  gen_expr -->|uses type metadata| tc_expr
  gen_emit_all_defers -->|delegates to scoped cleanup| gen_emit_defer_from
  gen_emit_defer_from -->|replays deferred expressions| gen_expr
  gen_emit_defer_from -->|writes cleanup tokens| code_emit

  include_expand_handle -->|processes each complete line| include_process_line
  include_expand_handle -->|owns temporary line buffer| allocation
  include_expand_handle -->|reads source handle| file_io
  include_process_line -->|opens nested module/C include| include_io
  include_process_line -->|records and checks dependency| dependency
  include_process_line -->|recurses into module source| include_expand_handle
  include_process_line -->|copies ordinary lines| source_io
  include_process_line -->|reports missing, cycle, or invalid include| source_import_fail

